Revision history for Medusa

0.01    Date/time
        First version, released on an unsuspecting world.

0.06    2026-10-08
        - Logger takes an exclusive lock and releases it with LOCK_UN; the
          shared lock it took before discarded every write on Windows
        - t/06-elapsed.t no longer requires the call to take under a second
        - :Audit works on perl 5.8 and 5.10, where the sub has no name yet
          when its attributes are applied
